
# Scratch: transport zips, macOS metadata, and the loose workflow copies
# that existed only because Finder hides dot-folders. The real workflows
# live in .github/workflows/ and git makes them reachable without duplicates.
.DS_Store
_to_delete/
/*.yml
/SPEC.md

